              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiyumvira umusi awiyumvira kubg’ Umwami wacu; ūrya inyama azirya kubg’ Umwami, kukw ashima Imana; kand’ ūtazirya, yanka kuzirya kubg’ Umwami, na we ashima Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ata muntu muri twebge ariho kubgiwe, cank’ apfa kubgiwe: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namba turiho, turiho kuba ab’ Umwami; kandi namba dupfa, dupfira kuba ab’ Umwami. Nuko namba turiho, canke namba dupfa, tur’ ab’ Umwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
